      "title": "Who is Alice Huang? The woman in the middle of Nvidia's alleged spy scandal",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/who-is-alice-huang-the-woman-in-the-middle-of-nvidia-s-alleged-spy-scandal-126111100091_1.html",
      "description": "Alice Huang, who US intelligence determined is a Chinese asset, emerged from the high-flying world of Shanghai finance to work with tech titans and obtain essential AI chips",
